<title>USA: Anergen names Smith CFO.</title>
<headline>Anergen names Smith CFO.</headline>
<dateline>REDWOOD CITY, Calif. 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anergen Inc Wednesday named David Smith to the post of vice president, finance and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said Smith, 37, joins Anergen after nine years at Genentech Inc, most recently as director of accounting.</p>
<p>Further details were not available.</p>
